# Known-bad fixtures that selftest/bad_modelica.py derives from baseline.json at
# run time. They are meant to be opened and diffed against the originals in
# selftest/assets/ — and they are meant to be REBUILT, never committed: a checked-in
# copy silently stops matching the moment a limit in baseline.json moves, and a
# control computed against a stale limit is a control that no longer falsifies
# anything while still reporting that it does.
selftest/.generated/
